  network 10.2.2.0 mask 255.255.255.0
  network 10.1.4.4 mask 255.255.255.252


========================== EIGRP ===========================
Distance Vector Protocol
DUAL Algorithm

Message:
- Hello - Dicovery and Maintains neighbor sessions
- Query - When an EIGRP router loses a route, it sends a query to its neighbors asking if they have a route to the destination.
- Updates
- Reply
- Hello (Ack)

Metric Weights for EIGRP Computation:

K1 = Bandwidth/Throughput
K2 = Load
K3 = Delay/Latency
K4 = Reliability
K5 = MTU

Default K Values:
K1 = 1, K2 = 0, K3 = 1, K4 = 0, K5 = 0

EIGRP Metric Formula:
Bandwidth = 10^7 / minimum bandwidth in kbps
Delay = sum of delays in tens of microseconds
(Bandwidth + Delay) * 256

Sample:
R4 to C1 Vlnan 10
Min BW = 10000 kbps
Delay = 1000 + 10

1000000 / 10000 = 1000
1010 / 10 = 101

256 * (1000 + 101) = 256 * 1101 = 281856



