==== NAMED EIGRP Metric calculation ====
WIDE Metric
1. Throughput
= 10000000 * 65536 / MIN-BW

2. Latency
= TotalDelay * 1000000 * 65536 / 1000000

3. Composite Metric
= Throughput + Latency

Sample:
R4 to C1 Vlan 10
1. Throughput
Min BW = 10000 kbps
= 10000000 * 65536 / 10000 = 65536000

2. Latency
Total Delay = 1000 + 10 = 1010
= 1010 * 1000000 * 65536 / 1000000 = 66191360

3. Composite Metric
= 65536000 + 66191360 = 131727360

NOTE: RIB-scale metric is 131727360 / 128 = 1029120


R4 to A1 10.1.49.0 /24
1. Throughput
Min BW = 10000
= 10000000 * 65536 / 10000 = 65536000

2. Latency
TotalDelay = 11010
= 11010 * 1000000 * 65536 / 1000000 = 721551360

3. Composite Metrics
= 65536000 + 721551360 = 787087360

RIB-Scale:
787087360 / 128 = 6149120









