Bandwidth

R3 e/1		= 10000
R4 e1/0 	= 10000
C1 vlan10	= 1000000

= 10000000 / 10000
= 1000

Delay
R3 e/1		= 1000
R4 e1/0 	= 1000
C1 vlan10	= 10

= (1000 + 1000 + 10) / 10
= 2010 / 10
= 201

Metric Computation:
256 * (1000 + 201)
256 * 1201




